<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:59.300" end="00:01:04.300" style="s2">TAKE THE GRAIN AND THE STEEL. LEAVE THE</p>
<p begin="00:01:01.700" end="00:01:04.300" style="s2">PEOPLE.</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.500" end="00:01:24.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HOLD THE BRIDGE.</p>
<p begin="00:01:51.600" end="00:01:54.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re one of us.</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.400" end="00:02:00.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m nothing</p>
<p begin="00:02:27.492" end="00:02:30.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cut them off AT THE REACH.</p>
<p begin="00:02:38.511" end="00:02:40.531" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:02:58.816" end="00:03:00.836" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:02.747" end="00:03:04.767" style="s2">[groaning and screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:03:12.592" end="00:03:15.792" style="s2">TAKE THE LAST ONE ALIVE.</p>
<p begin="00:03:21.742" end="00:03:23.762" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:03:28.992" end="00:03:37.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HE HAD THE GATE WATCH LAST NIGHT, ALONE.</p>
<p begin="00:03:33.292" end="00:03:41.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I saw the orc woman lowered her axe.</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.892" end="00:03:41.792" style="s2">She spoke to him like kin.</p>
<p begin="00:03:43.992" end="00:03:47.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I lost that knife last night.</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.487" end="00:04:15.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.294" end="00:04:33.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; TRAITOR. MAKE HIM PAY.</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.494" end="00:04:39.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 40 PEOPLE LIVED BECAUSE HE HELD THE</p>
<p begin="00:04:36.994" end="00:04:39.494" style="s2">BRIDGE.</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.094" end="00:04:52.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WARLOR,</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.394" end="00:04:52.194" style="s2">no orc stays inside these walls.</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.694" end="00:04:55.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll find who opened that gate.</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.794" end="00:05:19.494" style="s2">Stay alive.</p>
<p begin="00:05:43.594" end="00:05:47.994" style="s2">The gold I gave you,</p>
<p begin="00:05:45.594" end="00:05:47.994" style="s2">show me.</p>
<p begin="00:05:52.894" end="00:05:59.494" style="s2">There were five.</p>
<p begin="00:05:55.194" end="00:05:59.494" style="s2">Find it before anyone else does.</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.699" end="00:06:14.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.074" end="00:06:31.094" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:45.710" end="00:07:47.730" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:07:51.195" end="00:07:56.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; BETWEEN THE STONES. STRIKE BETWEEN THE</p>
<p begin="00:07:53.495" end="00:07:56.195" style="s2">STONES.</p>
<p begin="00:08:53.831" end="00:08:55.851" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:09:04.597" end="00:09:07.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THE BRIDGE KEEPER.</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.297" end="00:09:13.897" style="s2">YOU fight well for a human dog.</p>
<p begin="00:09:15.997" end="00:09:19.797" style="s2">The chieftain decides what you are.</p>
<p begin="00:09:34.441" end="00:09:36.461" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:09:40.897" end="00:09:44.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU COULD HAVE FINISHED ME ON THE</p>
<p begin="00:09:41.997" end="00:09:44.597" style="s2">BRIDGE.</p>
<p begin="00:09:46.397" end="00:09:51.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ORC TEETH.</p>
<p begin="00:09:47.797" end="00:09:51.097" style="s2">I don&#39;t cut down orcs.</p>
<p begin="00:10:08.497" end="00:10:12.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your raid got me exiled.</p>
<p begin="00:10:14.398" end="00:10:17.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your people buried our wells.</p>
<p begin="00:10:20.998" end="00:10:23.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We didn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:10:24.222" end="00:10:26.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [cough]</p>
<p begin="00:10:24.877" end="00:10:26.897" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:10:39.498" end="00:10:42.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Havorak.</p>
<p begin="00:10:47.398" end="00:10:51.298" style="s2">What an ugly human nose.</p>
<p begin="00:11:28.798" end="00:11:31.998" style="s2">Keep that hidden, boy.</p>
<p begin="00:11:42.298" end="00:11:47.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The humans filled our wells with stone.</p>
<p begin="00:11:49.298" end="00:11:53.898" style="s2">Anyone can take a coat</p>
<p begin="00:11:51.098" end="00:11:53.898" style="s2">or my knife.</p>
<p begin="00:11:56.198" end="00:11:59.698" style="s2">Someone is lying to both of us.</p>
<p begin="00:12:01.098" end="00:12:06.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who told you the gate of Harrowmere</p>
<p begin="00:12:03.298" end="00:12:06.198" style="s2">would be open?</p>
<p begin="00:12:07.898" end="00:12:11.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The chieftain has eyes everywhere.</p>
<p begin="00:12:20.099" end="00:12:24.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We took their grain.</p>
<p begin="00:12:21.699" end="00:12:24.399" style="s2">It is even.</p>
<p begin="00:12:25.299" end="00:12:30.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not even.</p>
<p begin="00:12:26.899" end="00:12:30.899" style="s2">In 10 days, we march.</p>
<p begin="00:12:33.258" end="00:12:35.278" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:12:35.878" end="00:12:37.898" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:12:40.499" end="00:12:45.758" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hold on, human nose.</p>
<p begin="00:12:43.738" end="00:12:45.758" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:12:47.899" end="00:12:51.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Again at dawn.</p>
<p begin="00:13:00.399" end="00:13:03.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re both tied up here.</p>
<p begin="00:13:22.499" end="00:13:27.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every tent. Leave nothing standing.</p>
<p begin="00:13:28.279" end="00:13:30.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:13:31.554" end="00:13:33.574" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:13:45.199" end="00:13:50.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; RIDERS, HOLD THEM BETWEEN THE TENTS.</p>
<p begin="00:14:09.299" end="00:14:13.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; EASY.</p>
<p begin="00:14:10.699" end="00:14:13.899" style="s2">WE RUN TOGETHER NOW.</p>
<p begin="00:14:14.784" end="00:14:16.804" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:14:30.101" end="00:14:34.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Took you long enough, human nose.</p>
<p begin="00:15:01.101" end="00:15:04.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; FALL BACK! FALL BACK!</p>
<p begin="00:15:07.185" end="00:15:09.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:15:27.701" end="00:15:31.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THE ONE WHO PAID TO OPEN HARARAMOR&#39;S</p>
<p begin="00:15:29.501" end="00:15:35.101" style="s2">GATE</p>
<p begin="00:15:31.501" end="00:15:35.101" style="s2">is the one who struck you tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:15:45.201" end="00:15:48.401" style="s2">They hit every tent</p>
<p begin="00:15:49.801" end="00:15:53.401" style="s2">but never went near the chieftains.</p>
<p begin="00:16:07.446" end="00:16:09.466" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:16:25.702" end="00:16:29.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The half orc fights like one of us.</p>
<p begin="00:16:34.002" end="00:16:38.602" style="s2">At dawn, he enters the stone circle.</p>
<p begin="00:16:55.602" end="00:16:59.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That horn is old ruins.</p>
<p begin="00:17:00.302" end="00:17:05.302" style="s2">He carried the Ruka chieftain, your</p>
<p begin="00:17:02.402" end="00:17:05.302" style="s2">mother&#39;s father.</p>
<p begin="00:17:16.802" end="00:17:20.702" style="s2">Morzun wiped out the Ruka, took his</p>
<p begin="00:17:19.102" end="00:17:22.302" style="s2">beast.</p>
<p begin="00:17:20.702" end="00:17:25.702" style="s2">If he learns,</p>
<p begin="00:17:22.302" end="00:17:25.702" style="s2">you never leave that circle.</p>
<p begin="00:17:42.802" end="00:17:47.902" style="s2">In war, no one may challenge the</p>
<p begin="00:17:45.302" end="00:17:47.902" style="s2">chieftain.</p>
<p begin="00:17:50.802" end="00:17:54.702" style="s2">That is why he needs his war.</p>
<p begin="00:17:58.702" end="00:18:01.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The half orc lives.</p>
<p begin="00:18:05.102" end="00:18:08.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not after dawn.</p>
<p begin="00:18:09.932" end="00:18:11.952" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:18:31.703" end="00:18:33.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ओ</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
